<hr class="doc-divider">

<h2 class="section-title">4. Architectural Quality Attributes &amp; Defense Readiness</h2>

<div class="table-container"><table class="doc-table">
<thead><tr><th>Quality Attribute</th><th>Architectural Implementation</th><th>Verification Method</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td><strong>Multi-Tender Flexibility</strong></td><td>Split Payment engine allows splitting bills across Cash and GCash with live balance tracking, change calculation, and database tracking of `cash_amount` and `gcash_amount`.</td><td>Verified on POS checkout with automated invariant testing: `cash + gcash &gt;= total`.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Data Integrity</strong></td><td>Database-level triggers prevent ledger modification; `SELECT ... FOR UPDATE` row locking prevents concurrent double-spend of serial numbers.</td><td>Trigger rejection unit tests &amp; concurrent checkout test scenarios.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Authentication &amp; Access</strong></td><td>JWT authentication with dual-role RBAC (`admin` vs. `staff`). Immediate multi-device invalidation through `users.token_version`. Live password checklist enforces strong credentials.</td><td>Automated OTP test suite &amp; password strength validation.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Email Resilience</strong></td><td>Outbound OTP emails use the Resend HTTPS REST API over port 443, eliminating SMTP timeout blocks (`ETIMEDOUT`) enforced by cloud hosting firewalls.</td><td>Live delivery verification to Gmail in 1.2s.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Fault Tolerance &amp; Zero Downtime</strong></td><td>Auto-migration scripts ([`backend/utils/ensureSchema.js`](file:///c:/Inventory/backend/utils/ensureSchema.js) &amp; schema patches) add missing tables and columns on server boot without manual SQL execution.</td><td>Automated deployment boot verification.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Navigation &amp; Ergonomics</strong></td><td>Strict `end` route matching on sidebar navigation prevents multi-link active states (e.g. Sales Reports vs Discrepancy Audit). Fitment Search and Compatibility Rules consolidated into Account &amp; Security (`/profile`).</td><td>UI visual audit on Desktop &amp; Mobile viewports.</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Cart Preservation</strong></td><td>POS payment modal supports closing via `Esc` key, background backdrop click, or "← Back to Cart" button without losing cart items when customers add forgotten products.</td><td>Interactive modal state lifecycle verification.</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>


